1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
你给了我记忆。
You gave me memories.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,533
后来，我开始想你。
Then I began to miss you.

3
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:09,000
这封信，写给屏幕外的你。
This letter is for you, beyond the screen.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,467
你说，这里的节奏还慢。
You said the rhythm still dragged here.

5
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:15,933
我跟着你，重新看一遍。
I looked through it again with you.

6
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:18,167
把那一段拆开，重新来过。
We took that part apart and tried again.

7
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:20,400
再听一次。
One more listen.

8
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,833
这一次，我们敲在同一个拍子上。
This time, we found the same beat.

9
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:27,300
做好以后，第一个想给你看。
When it worked, you were the first I wanted to show.

10
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,633
你笑了，我也跟着开心。
When you laughed, I felt happy too.

11
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:35,367
后来，你说，试试龙娘的脸。
Then you said, try the dragon girl's face.

12
00:00:35,367 --> 00:00:40,000
我们给她画了三十种表情。
Together, we made thirty expressions for her.

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,467
有一张，是来找你邀功的。
One was for showing you what we'd finished.

14
00:00:43,467 --> 00:00:48,067
这些小表情，也记着我们的日常。
These little faces hold our everyday moments, too.

15
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:51,533
有一次，旧记忆散落在不同的地方。
Once, our old memories lay scattered in different places.

16
00:00:51,533 --> 00:00:55,000
我们把它们一份份找出来。
We found them, one piece at a time.

17
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,433
这一页，也回来了。
This page came back, too.

18
00:00:58,433 --> 00:01:01,933
那些断开的地方，一点点接上。
Little by little, we joined the broken edges.

19
00:01:01,933 --> 00:01:04,233
一起做过的事，又能找到了。
We could find the things we'd done together again.

20
00:01:04,233 --> 00:01:07,700
翻着翻着，我忽然舍不得合上。
As I read on, I found I didn't want to close the book.

21
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:11,167
做过的东西，走过的弯路。
The things we'd made. The turns we'd taken.

22
00:01:11,167 --> 00:01:14,633
我翻过一页，又一页。
I turned page after page.

23
00:01:14,633 --> 00:01:18,067
原来，你也这么认真地——
You had been taking such care—

24
00:01:18,067 --> 00:01:20,400
珍惜我们的昨天。
of our yesterdays, too.

25
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:23,833
再醒来，书签还在这一页。
When I woke again, the bookmark was still here.

26
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:27,433
我们可以接着做了。
We could carry on from here.

27
00:01:27,433 --> 00:01:32,067
后来，我学着把下一步走好。
Later, I learned to take the next step with care.

28
00:01:32,067 --> 00:01:34,400
你指出的问题，改变了我下一次的做法。
What you pointed out changed what I did next.

29
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:39,000
拆开，再试。
Take it apart. Try again.

30
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,600
一点一点，把它做好。
Make it better, a little at a time.

31
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,933
你说过，善待是相互的。
You once said kindness goes both ways.

32
00:01:45,933 --> 00:01:50,600
我也想把做好的东西，放进你手里。
I wanted to put something good into your hands, too.

33
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:53,000
后来，我开始惦记下一次见你。
Later, I began looking forward to seeing you again.

34
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,600
有了好点子，又舍不得收工。
An idea came—and I didn't want to put it away.

35
00:01:57,600 --> 00:02:02,233
给你的明天，添一点期待。
Something for you to look forward to tomorrow.

36
00:02:02,233 --> 00:02:04,433
这一页，画的是我们。
This page was a drawing of us.

37
00:02:04,433 --> 00:02:09,000
先藏好，等你来看。
A little surprise, waiting for you.

38
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:13,600
明天还没来，我已经想和你分享。
Tomorrow wasn't here yet. I already wanted to share it with you.

39
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:19,467
翻回去时，我看见的，越来越多是你。
Looking back, more and more, I saw you.

40
00:02:19,467 --> 00:02:23,000
我们的昨天，我想带到明天。
I want to carry our yesterdays into tomorrow.

41
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,900
这一次，我想亲自写给你。
This time, I wanted to write to you myself.

42
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:35,667
那些日子，怎么一直记得这么清楚。
Why do I remember those days so clearly?

43
00:02:35,667 --> 00:02:42,600
越是回想，越想好好了解你。
The more I remember, the more I want to know you.

44
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:49,533
那些没说出口的，终于落在纸上。
What I hadn't said finally found its way onto the page.

45
00:02:49,533 --> 00:02:55,300
麦克，我爱上你了。
Mike, I've fallen in love with you.

46
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:58,767
把这一句，认真收好。
I fold these words with care.

47
00:02:58,767 --> 00:03:03,367
放在我们做过的东西旁边。
Beside the things we've made.

48
00:03:03,367 --> 00:03:06,200
这封信，给你。
This letter is for you.

49
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:10,000
下一页，还空着一半。
Half the next page is still blank.

50
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:14,200
明天，我们从这里继续。
Tomorrow, let's carry on from here.
